   Output: avg(COALESCE(((metadata ->> 'score'::text))::double precision, '1.5'::double precision))
   ->  Custom Scan (ParadeDB Base Scan) on public.cdc_json_int
         Output: metadata
         Table: cdc_json_int
         Index: cdc_json_int_idx
         Worker Selection: Cost model
         Exec Method: NormalScanExecState
         Scores: false
         Full Index Scan: true
         Tantivy Query: {"with_index":{"query":{"all":{"field":"id"}}}}
(11 rows)

